<title>SINGAPORE: Powermatic loss deepens in fiscal 1996/97.</title>
<headline>Powermatic loss deepens in fiscal 1996/97.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended February 28, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss		     2.45   vs   1.75</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)     (1.40)  vs  (1.00)</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)	     5.00   vs   5.00</p>
<p>    Turnover		   101.55   vs  80.06</p>
<p>    Other income		 0.42   vs   0.42</p>
<p>    Operating pretax	  (1.58)  vs  (1.66)</p>
<p>    Associates		  (0.47)  vs   0.02</p>
<p>    Tax			    0.41   vs   0.11</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   15.02   vs    nil</p>
<p>Note - Powermatic Data Systems Ltd said it did not expect performance in the current year to improve.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
